      },
      "id": "Field_1bix3kw"
    },
    {
      "text": "### How product availability is determined\n\nYour product will be available to customers only when:\n\n- The stock quantity is greater than zero\n- The current date is within the seasonal availability period.\n\nIf either condition is not met, the product will be marked as unavailable.\n\n**Please check your details before submitting.**",
      "type": "text",
      "layout": {
        "row": "Row_0p4qnaz",
        "columns": null
      },
      "id": "Field_1mlblti"
    }
